# Documentation Sync Rules

When making changes, automatically update relevant documentation:

## README.md Updates Required For:
- CI/CD changes (cloudbuild.yaml, Dockerfile, .gcloudignore)
- New environment variables
- New API endpoints (routes in src/app/api/)
- Project structure changes
- Deployment process changes
- New dependencies with special setup

## After Architecture Changes:
1. Update the "Project Structure" section if folders change
2. Update "API Flow" if request handling changes
3. Add troubleshooting entries for new error patterns

## Commit Practice:
- Include doc updates in the same commit as code changes
- If docs are complex, create a follow-up commit immediately after
